msgid "Manual synchronization"
msgstr "手動同期"

#: shopify-class-package/src/Interface/Admin/CommerceSyncPage.php:257
msgid ""
"Automatic catalog synchronization is requested at approximately 15-minute "
"intervals. Manual synchronization adds a catalog scan to the queue "
"immediately without waiting for the next automatic request. The queued task "
"is then processed in the background by WP-Cron."
msgstr ""
"カタログの自動同期は約15分間隔で要求されます。手動同期では、次回の自動要求を"
"待たずにカタログスキャンを直ちにキューへ追加します。キューに追加された処理"
"は、その後WP-Cronによってバックグラウンドで実行されます。"

#: shopify-class-package/src/Interface/Admin/CommerceSyncPage.php:258
msgid ""
"The scan imports Shopify products that are not yet connected to this site as "
"draft posts, updates sales information such as prices, inventory, and "
"Shopify product status, and marks connected products that no longer exist on "
"Shopify. Existing WordPress-specific titles, content, images, taxonomies, "
"and publication status are preserved."
msgstr ""
"このスキャンでは、このサイトとまだ連携していないShopify商品を下書き投稿として"
"取り込み、価格・在庫・Shopifyの商品状態などの販売情報を更新し、Shopifyに存在"
"しなくなった連携商品を記録します。WordPress固有のタイトル、本文、画像、タクソ"
"ノミー、公開状態は保持されます。"

#: shopify-class-package/src/Interface/Admin/CommerceSyncPage.php:262
msgid "Synchronization options"
msgstr "同期オプション"

#: shopify-class-package/src/Interface/Admin/CommerceSyncPage.php:264
msgid ""
"Restore Shopify products that were permanently deleted from this WordPress "
"site."
msgstr "このWordPressサイトから完全に削除されたShopify商品を復元します。"

#: shopify-class-package/src/Interface/Admin/CommerceSyncPage.php:266
msgid "Queue synchronization"
msgstr "同期をキューに登録"

#: shopify-class-package/src/Interface/Admin/CommerceSyncPage.php:273
msgid "Queue processing log"
msgstr "キュー処理のログ"

#: shopify-class-package/src/Interface/Admin/CommerceSyncPage.php:274
msgid ""
"The table shows the 50 most recent synchronization queue items. Completed "
"and cancelled items are automatically deleted after seven days. Pending and "
"retry items remain until processing finishes, and failed items remain "
"available for review and manual retry."
msgstr ""
"この表には直近50件の同期キュー項目が表示されます。完了または取り消された項目"
"は7日後に自動削除されます。待機中および再試行中の項目は処理が完了するまで保持"
"され、失敗した項目は確認と手動再試行のために保持されます。"

#: shopify-class-package/src/Interface/Admin/CommerceSyncPage.php:276
msgid "The 50 most recent commerce synchronization queue items."
msgstr "直近50件のコマース同期キュー項目です。"

